{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/preferences"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Protocols","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey"],"anchor":"Protocols"},{"title":"Storage","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues"],"anchor":"Storage"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass data from child views up to their ancestors."}],"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Preferences","roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit’s preference system enables "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"bottom-up data flow","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the reverse of environment values. While the environment passes data down from parent to child, preferences let child views publish values that ancestors can observe and react to."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The system mirrors SwiftUI’s preference API and consists of three parts:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey"}]},{"text":": Protocol that defines a named value type with a default and a reduce strategy","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Type-safe storage that holds all preference values for a scope","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceStorage"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Stack-based collector that manages preference contexts per render pass","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A built-in example is "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":": a child view sets "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigationTitle(\"Settings\")"},{"type":"text","text":", and the enclosing navigation container reads that preference to render the title bar."}]},{"anchor":"Defining-a-Preference-Key","text":"Defining a Preference Key","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A preference key declares what type of value it carries and how multiple values from sibling children are combined:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct CounterKey: PreferenceKey {","    static let defaultValue: Int = 0","","    static func reduce(value: inout Int, nextValue: () -> Int) {","        value += nextValue()","    }","}"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"defaultValue"}]},{"text":": Returned when no child has set this preference","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"reduce(value:nextValue:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Combines values when multiple children set the same key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default "},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation simply takes the last value. Override it when you need additive behavior (summing counts), array collection, or other merge strategies."}]},{"anchor":"Setting-a-Preference","text":"Setting a Preference","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Child views publish a preference using the ","type":"text"},{"code":".preference(key:value:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct ItemView: View {","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Item\")","            .preference(key: CounterKey.self, value: 1)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Under the hood, this wraps the view in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"PreferenceModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"preferences.setValue(_:forKey:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" during rendering. The value is reduced into the current scope using the key’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" function.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Observing-Preferences","text":"Observing Preferences","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ancestor views react to collected preferences using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onPreferenceChange(_:perform:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct ItemList: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","        }","        .onPreferenceChange(CounterKey.self) { totalCount in","            \/\/ totalCount == 3 (three children each set value: 1, additive reduce)","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier pushes a new preference context, renders all children (which set their preferences), pops the context, and fires the callback with the accumulated result."}]},{"anchor":"The-Navigation-Title-Shortcut","text":"The Navigation Title Shortcut","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit provides ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" as a built-in preference key with a convenience modifier:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct SettingsPage: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            Text(\"App settings go here\")","        }","        .navigationTitle(\"Settings\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"NavigationTitleKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" uses the default "},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (last value wins), so the deepest child’s title takes precedence."}]},{"anchor":"How-Preferences-Flow-per-Frame","text":"How Preferences Flow per Frame","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Preferences are collected fresh every frame. Here’s the lifecycle within a single render pass:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reset"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"RenderLoop.render()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"preferences.beginRenderPass()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", clearing all callbacks and resetting the stack to a single empty context","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": As the view tree renders top-down, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceModifier"},{"text":" views call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setValue(_:forKey:)"},{"text":", which reduces values into the current stack frame","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Scope"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"code":"OnPreferenceChangeModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" pushes a new context before rendering its subtree, isolating child preferences"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Collect","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": After the subtree finishes, the modifier pops the context (merging into the parent) and fires the callback with the scoped result"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discard"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": At the start of the next frame, everything resets: stale preferences never persist"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This per-frame reset ensures preferences always reflect the current view tree. Removed views stop contributing automatically.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Reduce-Strategies","text":"Reduce Strategies","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" function determines how multiple children’s values combine. Common patterns:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Strategy","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Implementation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use Case"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Last value wins"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value = nextValue()"},{"type":"text","text":" (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Titles, labels: deepest child wins","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additive"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"value += nextValue()","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Counting items, summing heights"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Array collection","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value.append(contentsOf: nextValue())"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gathering menu 